WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.812 --> 00:00:06.389
This is how I met my brothers.

00:00:09.096 --> 00:00:10.652
And how we became family.

00:00:11.602 --> 00:00:13.041
It's way bigger than basketball.

00:00:14.873 --> 00:00:16.541
It was us against everybody.

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:18.973
People think they know my story...

00:00:20.241 --> 00:00:21.843
but this is how it all began.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:24.285
A lot of memories in this gym.

00:00:24.327 --> 00:00:24.851
Absolutely, man.

00:00:25.523 --> 00:00:27.747
How we put banners up, how we win ball games.

00:00:29.121 --> 00:00:31.413
What's crazy is, the practices may have went even harder.

00:00:32.262 --> 00:00:33.832
But that's what made the games so easy, bro.

00:00:36.187 --> 00:00:37.303
That family bond...

00:00:38.282 --> 00:00:39.846
lasts for a lifetime.

00:00:41.405 --> 00:00:42.342
We in it together.

00:00:42.772 --> 00:00:43.943
We going down or we going up.

00:00:44.167 --> 00:00:45.674
Most of the time, we going up.

00:00:46.298 --> 00:00:47.176
This is my story.

00:00:47.177 --> 00:00:49.325
My story.

00:00:49.588 --> 00:00:51.023
This is our story.

00:01:05.146 --> 00:01:07.146
Everybody is special in their own way,

00:01:08.062 --> 00:01:10.516
but then when you put us together we're like a superhero or--

00:01:11.113 --> 00:01:12.462
We're like Captain Planet, cuz

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:14.081
